{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"五京鄉丁","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"遼建五京：臨潢，契丹故壤；遼陽，漢之遼東，為渤海故國；中京，漢遼西地，自唐以來契丹有之。三京丁籍可紀者二十二萬六千一百，蕃漢轉戶為多。析津、大同，故漢地，籍丁八十萬六千七百。契丹本戶多隸宮帳、部族，其餘蕃漢戶丁分隸者，皆不與焉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"太祖建皇都于臨潢府。太宗定晉，晉主石敬瑭來獻十六城，乃定四京，改皇都為上京。有丁一十六萬七千二百。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"臨潢府：","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"臨潢縣丁七千。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"長泰縣丁八千。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"保和縣丁六千。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"定霸縣丁六千。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"宣化縣丁四千。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"潞縣丁六千。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"易俗縣丁一千五百。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"遷遼縣丁一千五百。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"祖州：","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"長霸縣丁四千。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"咸寧縣丁二千。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"越王城丁二千。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"懷州：","sentenceOrder":