tTraditional":"聖宗統和二十三年，城七金山，建大定府，號中京。統縣九，轄軍、府、州、城二十三。草創未定，丁籍莫考，可見者一縣：","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_162","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"高州三韓縣丁一萬。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_163","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"大約五京民丁可見者，一百一十萬七千三百為鄉兵。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_164","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"屬國軍","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_165","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"遼屬國可紀者五十有九，朝貢無常。有事則遣使徵兵，或下詔專征；不從者討之。助軍眾寡，各從其便，無常額。又有鐵不得國者，興宗重熙十七年乞以兵助攻夏國，詔不許。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_166","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"吐谷渾。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_167","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"鐵驪。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_168","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"靺鞨。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_169","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"兀惹。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_170","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"黑車子室韋。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_171","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"西奚。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_172","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"東部奚。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_173","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"烏馬山奚。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_174","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"斜離底。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_175","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"突厥。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_176","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"党項。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_177","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"小蕃。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_178","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTra