h_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"敵烈。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_216","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"粘八葛。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_217","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"梅里急。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_218","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"耶睹刮。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_219","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"鼻骨德。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_220","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"和州回鶻。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_221","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"斡朗改。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_222","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"高麗。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_223","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"西夏。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_224","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"女直。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_225","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"遼之為國，鄰於梁、唐、晉、漢、周、宋。晉以恩故，始則父子一家，終則寇讎相攻；梁、唐、周隱然一敵國；宋惟太宗征北漢，遼不能救，餘多敗衄，縱得亦不償失。良由石晉獻土，中國失五關之固然也。高麗小邦，屢喪遼兵，非以險阻足恃故歟。西夏彈丸之地，南敗宋，東抗遼。雖西北士馬雄勁，元昊、諒祚智勇過人，能使党項、阻卜掣肘大國，蓋亦襟山帶河，有以助其勢耳。雖然，宋久失地利，而舊志言兵，唯以敵宋為務。踰三關，聚議北京，猶不敢輕進。豈不以大河在前，三鎮在後，臨事好謀之審，不容不然歟。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_226","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"二帳、十二宮一府、五京，有兵一百六十四萬二千八百。宮丁、大首領、諸部族，中京、頭下等州，屬國之眾，皆不與焉。不輕用之，所以長世。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_227","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"邊境戍兵","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_228","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"又得高麗大遼事跡，載東境戍兵，以備高麗、女直等國，見其守國規模，布置簡要，舉一可知三邊矣。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_229","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"東京至鴨淥西北峰為界：","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_230","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"黃龍府正兵五千。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_231","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"咸州正兵一千。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_232","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"東京沿女直界至鴨淥江：","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_233","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"軍堡凡七十，各守軍二十人，計正兵一千四百。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_234","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"來遠城宣義軍營八：","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_235","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"太子營正兵三百。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_236","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"大營正兵六百。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_237","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"蒲州營正兵二百。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_238","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"新營正兵五百。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_239","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"加陀營正兵三百。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_240","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"王海城正兵三百。","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_241","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"柳白營正兵四百。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_242","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"沃野營正兵一千。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_243","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"神虎軍城正兵一萬。大康十年置。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_36_244","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_36","textTraditional":"右一府、一州、二城、七十堡、八營，計正兵二萬二千。","sentenceOrder":244}],"overrides":{}}